<title>USA: Yelm SD 2, Wash., yields 5.30 pct in 2010.</title>
<headline>Yelm SD 2, Wash., yields 5.30 pct in 2010.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>SeaFirst Bank said it tentatively priced $2.295 million of Thurston and Pierce Counties School District No. 2 (Yelm), Wash., unlimited tax general obligation bonds with a top yield of 5.30 percent in 2010.</p>
</text>
